// # hitl — Human-in-the-Loop
//
// Logline: The verify_human primitive — TTY-based approval with env-gated auto-approve. Fail-closed by default; requires OODA_HITL_ALLOW to enable.
//
// Setup: hitl.c is the implementation. Requires EnvCap + FsCap. Policy env allowlisted (OODA_HITL_ALLOW). On accept, returns Ok("approved"); on deny, returns Err(E_HITL).
//
// Beats:
//   1. Read hitl.c — the verify_human TTY path.
//
// ──▓▓ hitl ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: fail-closed: no env, no HITL ::
